WEBVTT

00:35.827 --> 00:36.828
Don't be scared.

00:37.495 --> 00:38.747
They're blanks, guys.

00:39.956 --> 00:41.082
It's not easy

00:41.750 --> 00:45.795
finding bullets in a country
that doesn't allow us to have guns.

00:47.380 --> 00:48.882
I got five more shots.

00:49.883 --> 00:51.634
Hey, you gotta get closer. Come on.

00:52.218 --> 00:53.636
Come on, bring it in.

00:53.720 --> 00:55.597
Come on, you bastards. Go get him!

00:56.222 --> 00:57.932
Uh… But he's got a gun.

00:58.433 --> 01:01.227
He just told you they're
fucking blanks! Go on! Hurry!

01:01.311 --> 01:03.813
Go! Get him, you assholes!

01:08.151 --> 01:10.612
-Come on! That's it!
-Motherfucker!

01:21.247 --> 01:23.124
Come here! Yes, you!

01:29.964 --> 01:31.341
Come here, asshole!

01:34.803 --> 01:36.346
-You! You bastard!
-Bastard!

01:36.429 --> 01:37.972
Motherfucker!

01:40.350 --> 01:42.018
Damn it.

01:55.949 --> 01:57.742
You asshole!

02:00.078 --> 02:02.413
Hey, two shots.
He's got two left. Two! That's it!

02:02.497 --> 02:04.582
It must be nice to be young!

02:47.167 --> 02:48.293
Shit…

02:56.718 --> 02:57.927
That last one…

02:59.345 --> 03:00.430
that was real.

03:02.223 --> 03:03.224
Where are you?

03:03.808 --> 03:05.185
I'm sorry, sir.

03:05.685 --> 03:07.645
Yeah? What's going on?

03:07.729 --> 03:08.813
He…

03:10.023 --> 03:12.817
He, uh… he snuck into the alley,

03:13.610 --> 03:15.320
but we lost him.

03:15.403 --> 03:16.988
You lost an old guy?

03:18.990 --> 03:20.074
End the call.

03:21.075 --> 03:22.035
Sir, uh…

03:24.204 --> 03:25.163
You…

03:25.955 --> 03:27.207
you little shit.

03:34.464 --> 03:35.423
Good work.

03:38.384 --> 03:39.844
Now, where were we?

03:42.222 --> 03:43.223
He said…

03:44.974 --> 03:46.351
to… to bring you alive.

03:47.060 --> 03:50.188
So… so he could do what you did
to his granddaughter.

03:50.271 --> 03:52.106
Wait a minute. Hang on. I know this.

03:52.190 --> 03:54.192
The… the, uh…

03:54.275 --> 03:56.569
the… art bitch, huh?

03:57.153 --> 03:58.321
Yeah?

03:58.404 --> 04:00.782
God, what was her name? Her name, uh…

04:00.865 --> 04:02.200
Hyeong…

04:02.283 --> 04:04.118
-H… Hyeong Ji-su.
-Hyeong Ji-su!

04:05.954 --> 04:08.373
Hyeong Jeong-guk, Hyeong Ji-su.

04:09.332 --> 04:11.334
Hah!

04:26.975 --> 04:29.310
A KILLER PARADOX

04:43.032 --> 04:44.534
I appreciate it. Ah!

04:50.290 --> 04:52.834
How'd you become a detective, sir?

04:54.711 --> 04:55.837
Why do you ask?

04:57.505 --> 04:59.632
I don't know.
You know, what led you to it?

05:07.307 --> 05:10.977
-Well, uh, my dad was on the force, so…
-Oh.

05:12.228 --> 05:14.063
He was a peculiar man.

05:14.147 --> 05:17.025
So you became a cop
to follow in his footsteps?

05:17.108 --> 05:18.609
No, it's the opposite.

05:19.527 --> 05:22.030
It was because
I didn't wanna be looked down on.

05:33.916 --> 05:36.210
-Hey, Nan-gam.
-Hello, sir.

05:38.838 --> 05:39.964
Leave it there.

05:43.217 --> 05:46.054
My father was this cold, gruff man,

05:47.096 --> 05:49.223
who never smiled at me, even once.

05:49.891 --> 05:51.517
All he ever did was scold me.

06:06.908 --> 06:08.910
Hey, you brat! You little…

06:08.993 --> 06:11.579
What are you doing going
through my stuff, huh? Huh?

06:12.955 --> 06:14.290
What are you, a thief now?

06:15.291 --> 06:16.125
Huh?

06:16.709 --> 06:18.002
Is that what you want to be?

06:18.586 --> 06:21.923
When he was having a bad day,
he would lash out at me for no reason.

06:22.006 --> 06:23.841
Now, how's five hits sound?
With this.

06:23.925 --> 06:25.343
STAR KARAOKE

06:25.426 --> 06:26.677
And it's gonna hurt.

06:26.761 --> 06:29.472
-What do you say?
-What is it this time? Hmm?

06:29.972 --> 06:32.016
-Well?
-Oh, this little shit.

06:32.100 --> 06:33.267
He ratted me out to his mom.

06:33.351 --> 06:35.645
He told her that I'd been going there.

06:35.728 --> 06:39.107
-Nan-gam, you'll get it when you grow up.
-He looked for excuses to bully me.

06:39.690 --> 06:40.817
Take it back, boss.

06:41.734 --> 06:44.362
-It's not mine, though.
-Hey, go on. Get to work. Hurry.

06:44.445 --> 06:46.781
Right, I left it here. Yeah.

06:46.864 --> 06:48.032
Apologize, now.

06:49.492 --> 06:50.576
Beg for mercy.

06:51.160 --> 06:54.789
But one day, I didn't feel
like taking his crap anymore.

06:54.872 --> 06:55.790
Am I clear?

06:56.833 --> 06:59.460
And I guess it just stopped
being fun for him.

07:00.920 --> 07:03.089
Ever since then, he stopped bothering me.

07:03.172 --> 07:04.048
Huh.

07:06.008 --> 07:07.802
That's when I learned my lesson.

07:09.512 --> 07:11.055
I didn't want to be pathetic.

07:11.139 --> 07:12.098
What was it?

07:12.181 --> 07:13.182
What?

07:13.266 --> 07:15.101
Uh, the lesson you mentioned just then?

07:18.604 --> 07:20.314
Oh, it was…

07:23.151 --> 07:25.027
if you don't want them
to have power over you,

07:25.111 --> 07:27.321
don't give them
the reaction they're seeking.

07:28.406 --> 07:29.574
Somethin' like that.

07:32.034 --> 07:34.245
So why did I bring this up
all of a sudden?

07:37.123 --> 07:39.000
I'm saying you should do the same.

07:45.339 --> 07:47.550
TO BE PUT DOWN
BASED ON THE AGGRESSION TEST RESULT

07:47.633 --> 07:49.886
That one extra line could
either save him or kill him.

07:50.928 --> 07:54.056
He'll get his test this week
by the professional trainers.

07:54.140 --> 07:58.019
We're gonna do a behavioral test and refer
to other foreign materials as well.

07:58.102 --> 07:59.145
Hmm…

07:59.729 --> 08:02.607
This is our first time,
so I want to set a good precedent.

08:02.690 --> 08:03.566
Here, drink this.

08:05.693 --> 08:07.361
How do you think it's gonna go?

08:07.445 --> 08:10.781
Well, he's been staying with you,
so what do you think, sir?

08:11.657 --> 08:12.658
Not sure.

08:13.576 --> 08:16.078
If the euthanasia gets canceled,

08:16.162 --> 08:19.373
we'll get him some more training
and we'll find him a new owner.

08:20.124 --> 08:23.044
It won't be easy.
He was involved in such a huge case.

08:25.129 --> 08:26.214
Detective?

08:26.797 --> 08:29.675
Any chance you want to keep him?
He seems to like you.

08:32.094 --> 08:34.347
I don't know
that I'm really cut out for that.

08:35.389 --> 08:38.142
Whatever happens, that's it, I guess.

08:42.522 --> 08:44.273
Jang, did you get the call?

08:44.357 --> 08:45.316
CAPTAIN MOON MYEONG-JUN

08:45.399 --> 08:46.692
I pulled some strings.

08:47.360 --> 08:49.278
I'll get you as many men as you need.

08:50.154 --> 08:51.280
Let's do this.

08:52.198 --> 08:54.158
Yes, sir. Appreciate it.

08:55.326 --> 08:56.869
I'll be getting there on time.

08:57.370 --> 08:59.247
All right. See you soon.

09:02.500 --> 09:04.877
-A bit further to this side.
-Okay.

09:04.961 --> 09:07.088
Can we fast-forward a little more?

09:07.588 --> 09:09.423
-Sure.
-Yeah, there.

09:10.007 --> 09:13.511
This bar's been closed for a long time,
so no one really comes here.

09:13.594 --> 09:16.097
But we got calls from nearby
shop owners that heard gunshots.

09:16.180 --> 09:17.473
Were the hell did he get a gun?

09:18.057 --> 09:19.600
There's Lee Tang. Yeah.

09:20.184 --> 09:21.394
-That's him.
-Hmm.

09:25.439 --> 09:27.692
Roll it back to the beginning
of the footage real quick.

09:27.775 --> 09:28.776
Okay.

09:32.238 --> 09:33.364
-Stop.
-Okay.

09:33.447 --> 09:34.907
Who are all those guys?

09:34.991 --> 09:37.076
Oh, them.
They're from Gajok Construction.

09:37.159 --> 09:39.620
Looks like our Roh Bin got in touch
with them before we could.

09:40.121 --> 09:42.081
REINSTATE WORKERS
CHAIRMAN HYEONG JEONG-GUK, RESIGN

09:42.164 --> 09:44.542
-We said no. You need a warrant.
-Come on!

09:44.625 --> 09:46.377
-We'll just be a minute.
-Resign!

09:46.460 --> 09:48.045
We'll be out in no time.

09:48.129 --> 09:50.381
-Reinstate fired workers!
-No. We're busy.

09:50.464 --> 09:52.216
-I said leave!
-Come on.

09:52.300 --> 09:54.385
Hey! You're obstructing business, huh?

09:55.469 --> 09:57.221
-You don't have a warrant, do you?
-Yes, sir.

09:57.305 --> 09:59.390
-Resign!
-I can't even get in the building.

09:59.473 --> 10:02.226
Yeah, they just won't allow us to go in.

10:03.644 --> 10:07.106
-All right. You can wrap it up for now--
-Excuse me.

10:08.024 --> 10:09.483
I think I found it, sir.

10:09.984 --> 10:11.277
Look… there.

10:12.069 --> 10:15.072
This is as far as I can zoom in.

10:15.156 --> 10:16.699
And that alley back there…

10:17.199 --> 10:19.493
it doesn't have any cameras installed yet.

10:26.876 --> 10:29.003
HAPPY MOTEL

10:29.086 --> 10:30.004
Hello.

10:30.087 --> 10:31.380
Have you seen this man?

10:32.089 --> 10:33.341
He's pretty tall.

10:36.636 --> 10:38.220
Not that I'm aware of, no.

10:39.305 --> 10:42.266
-Are you really cops, though?
-Yes, from Mapo. Here's my ID.

10:43.059 --> 10:47.396
It's just that some thugs were
asking about the same man earlier.

10:47.480 --> 10:48.606
Some thugs?

10:48.689 --> 10:51.609
Huge guys. They were
walking around all thug-like.

10:51.692 --> 10:52.526
When was that?

10:53.277 --> 10:55.571
I'd say about an hour ago. Yeah.

10:55.655 --> 10:57.073
How many of them were there?

10:57.698 --> 10:59.367
Four or five guys, I think.

11:34.402 --> 11:36.612
Hey, what the…

11:37.822 --> 11:40.157
Sir, take a look at this.

11:40.658 --> 11:42.493
What is it? Blood?

11:42.576 --> 11:44.745
Jesus. What does it say?

11:44.829 --> 11:46.122
I APOLOGIZE
I REPENT WITH MY DEATH

11:46.205 --> 11:47.623
A letter of apology?

12:00.886 --> 12:03.973
Shall we escape
this complicated world together?

12:06.183 --> 12:07.059
Huh?

12:11.188 --> 12:13.482
SHALL WE ESCAPE
THIS COMPLICATED WORLD TOGETHER?

12:19.405 --> 12:20.281
Let's go.

12:22.366 --> 12:23.325
And don't worry.

12:24.118 --> 12:26.537
-About what?
-Song Chon'll be caught soon.

12:27.037 --> 12:28.748
-What about us?
-We--

12:28.831 --> 12:30.458
-Here you go.
-Thank you.

12:30.958 --> 12:32.877
We'll go somewhere no one can find us.

12:33.377 --> 12:36.046
-Where are we gonna go?
-South.

12:36.839 --> 12:38.215
Like, south where?

12:43.637 --> 12:44.472
Listen.

12:45.681 --> 12:46.974
I've got a plan.

12:47.475 --> 12:50.394
And I've figured out a way
to solve all of our problems.

12:50.895 --> 12:54.982
All we need to do is go somewhere warm
in the south and chart out the future.

12:55.900 --> 12:59.278
Well… if you'll come along with me.

13:13.125 --> 13:14.460
-Oops.
-Hey.

13:14.543 --> 13:16.629
Sorry, I haven't driven in a while.

13:25.054 --> 13:27.640
Here,
your second phone has been activated.

13:27.723 --> 13:31.393
This was the registered owner
of the burner. Say hello.

13:34.438 --> 13:36.690
-Where is she--
-Just messing. You look so serious.

13:36.774 --> 13:39.777
Oh. Here's 500,000 won.

13:40.653 --> 13:41.987
Okay, great, yeah.

13:42.655 --> 13:45.491
It's just… they've been
really cracking down on us,

13:45.574 --> 13:48.786
and, uh, it's been especially hard
to find new identities these…

13:48.869 --> 13:50.246
Hey, come on. Hey, dude.

13:50.329 --> 13:52.498
-Things have been tough!
-Sorry to hear that. Bye.

13:53.165 --> 13:59.797
HELP FIND MY MISSING SON (MALE, 20S)
PLEASE CONTACT US IF YOU SEE HIM

14:27.825 --> 14:30.744
She's been coming to the morning
service pretty often these days.

14:30.828 --> 14:31.745
Who?

14:31.829 --> 14:34.164
Right there.
The lady sitting in the front row.

14:34.248 --> 14:36.125
Oh, you mean Deacon Kim?

14:36.208 --> 14:39.336
Haven't you heard?
Her son's been missing for quite a while.

14:39.837 --> 14:42.256
Oh no. Seriously? For how long?

14:43.173 --> 14:44.842
Oh God, that poor thing.

14:50.598 --> 14:52.266
God, please…

15:44.109 --> 15:45.361
Hello!

15:47.363 --> 15:48.697
Aah!

15:49.782 --> 15:51.325
What took you so long, huh?

15:52.034 --> 15:53.452
Yeah, I waited a while.

15:54.703 --> 15:56.830
Ah, shit.

16:06.882 --> 16:08.759
So where is he?

16:10.052 --> 16:11.387
Where's the chairman?

16:12.137 --> 16:15.057
The last footage of him
was in the Magok area.

16:15.140 --> 16:17.184
His whereabouts are unknown since then.

16:17.893 --> 16:20.062
Look, if you watch here,
he's moving around,

16:20.145 --> 16:23.524
operating as if he, uh… knows
where all the cameras are located.

16:24.024 --> 16:26.527
How far is this place
from that Gajok Construction,

16:26.610 --> 16:28.612
or Buyeon, or whatever it's called now?

16:28.696 --> 16:31.156
It's about a ten-minute drive, I believe.

16:31.240 --> 16:32.199
Ten minutes.

16:36.912 --> 16:38.205
SONG CHON

16:39.081 --> 16:40.082
HYEONG JEONG-GUK
CHAIRMAN

16:40.165 --> 16:42.292
Do we have a location on Chairman Hyeong?

16:43.585 --> 16:45.713
We have a couple of places
in mind, don't we?

16:45.796 --> 16:50.092
Yeah… The only thing is, uh,
they rejected our warrant request, so--

16:50.175 --> 16:52.052
Hey, I'm not trying
to meet Chairman Hyeong.

16:52.136 --> 16:54.263
We need to look for places
Song Chon might go.

16:54.346 --> 16:57.558
Well, uh… Look, I really don't think
he would take it that far, though.

16:57.641 --> 16:59.810
-Yeah, we don't have to--
-Uh, I know this bastard.

16:59.893 --> 17:02.730
He absolutely would.
Why do you think he's still in the area?

17:03.564 --> 17:05.024
So where is Chairman Hyeong?

17:05.524 --> 17:06.608
Uh…

17:07.526 --> 17:10.237
This was technically off the record,
but apparently

17:11.155 --> 17:13.240
he's at a very private location.

17:13.323 --> 17:15.284
Then that's where
Song Chon will likely go.

17:15.367 --> 17:17.619
Huh? I'll take the heat if it goes wrong.

17:17.703 --> 17:19.204
-Let's go. Come with me.
-Okay.

17:19.955 --> 17:21.123
Great.

17:26.503 --> 17:27.546
CAPTAIN MOON MYEONG-JUN

17:33.385 --> 17:35.012
Yes, sir, it's, um…

17:35.721 --> 17:37.222
it's me, yeah, uh…

17:38.515 --> 17:40.934
The chairman, he wants to be alone.

17:42.227 --> 17:44.646
He doesn't want anyone
to come in for a while.

17:44.730 --> 17:45.856
For how long?

17:48.150 --> 17:49.359
For how long?

17:50.986 --> 17:53.072
Mm… an hour.

17:55.949 --> 17:57.076
For one hour.

17:59.078 --> 18:00.037
Okay.

18:01.663 --> 18:02.748
That was good.

18:05.292 --> 18:06.543
All right, then.

18:09.213 --> 18:10.214
Take this

18:11.131 --> 18:13.175
and have a nice little nap, huh?

18:22.059 --> 18:23.644
-What'd the girl say?
-Hmm?

18:25.020 --> 18:28.065
What do you think?
He wants to be alone for a while.

18:28.148 --> 18:29.274
Hah! Why?

18:30.818 --> 18:32.694
'Cause he's mourning
his granddaughter's death

18:32.778 --> 18:35.322
with a girl her same age.

18:35.405 --> 18:37.366
An admirable man, shit.

18:37.449 --> 18:39.326
If that's the life you wanna live…

18:44.456 --> 18:45.457
Now

18:46.583 --> 18:48.043
we can have

18:48.669 --> 18:49.837
a nice little chat.

18:53.841 --> 18:55.300
You, sir, are a…

18:56.009 --> 18:57.678
a very compelling man.

19:00.055 --> 19:03.642
I heard it's easier
to list the things that you can't do

19:03.725 --> 19:05.602
than to find the things that you can.

19:07.104 --> 19:08.689
You're a minor, aren't you?

19:08.772 --> 19:11.733
-No, I'm not.
-I could have you arrested right now.

19:12.442 --> 19:14.987
-All right! Sir!
-Yes?

19:15.070 --> 19:17.072
-Pour you a glass?
-Absolutely.

19:17.156 --> 19:18.866
-Your health, sir!
-Drink up!

19:18.949 --> 19:21.827
Back-alley thugs
to government higher-ups.

19:21.910 --> 19:22.786
Drink up!

19:22.870 --> 19:24.872
You have connections everywhere.

19:24.955 --> 19:26.707
Hmm. Where's my cigarette?

19:27.666 --> 19:28.667
Aah.

19:30.627 --> 19:32.796
Oh, no, sir, let me, let me.

19:32.880 --> 19:34.006
Come on…

19:40.888 --> 19:42.681
TAX EVASION, EMBEZZLEMENT, BRIBERY

19:42.764 --> 19:45.517
Just… consider this
a short holiday, sir. Huh?

19:46.059 --> 19:48.103
Even when you were in prison,

19:48.604 --> 19:52.232
you had all those people
lining up to do you a favor.

19:52.316 --> 19:55.986
I'm pretty certain that we'll get
you that pardon that we're after.

19:56.069 --> 19:57.654
Only two pieces of eel?

19:58.697 --> 20:00.490
You should have brought more of it.

20:01.074 --> 20:03.827
Oh, I'm sorry, sir.
The fresh fish looked great today.

20:03.911 --> 20:04.953
Take your time.

20:06.622 --> 20:10.667
With you around, no wonder
your granddaughter turned out how she did.

20:10.751 --> 20:11.919
You guys were alike.

20:20.844 --> 20:22.095
I heard that

20:23.263 --> 20:26.975
a lot of people died
because of the buildings you demolished.

20:27.517 --> 20:30.562
How do you think
the victims' families would feel,

20:31.605 --> 20:36.068
seeing that dumb little smirk of yours
on the TV?

20:36.818 --> 20:42.199
You know, I can't just sit around
when I witness injustice.

20:45.327 --> 20:49.456
You'll be on
the nine o'clock news tomorrow too.

20:49.539 --> 20:51.875
It's a real shame
you won't be able to see it.

20:54.253 --> 20:57.965
When you're on the news tomorrow,
people will say,

20:59.007 --> 21:00.300
"Yeah."

21:01.009 --> 21:03.679
"That guy had it coming."

21:03.762 --> 21:06.223
"Whoever killed him's a great guy!"

21:10.686 --> 21:11.812
All right.

21:11.895 --> 21:12.938
Now it's time

21:14.356 --> 21:16.024
you write your letter of apology.

21:17.317 --> 21:18.902
Today is special.

21:19.653 --> 21:21.321
-So we'll write it--
-He isn't here.

21:22.531 --> 21:25.325
Hey, you can't go in!

21:25.409 --> 21:28.745
-I don't care if you're cops.
-Your boss is in danger!

21:38.672 --> 21:41.425
I-- I think
you should get over here quickly.

21:43.176 --> 21:44.511
Put that down.

21:44.594 --> 21:45.637
This thing

21:46.430 --> 21:47.514
is in his artery.

21:48.390 --> 21:51.852
It's over if I pull this out.
Wanna see some blood, people?

21:51.935 --> 21:52.894
Go ahead.

21:53.895 --> 21:54.938
But you'll die too.

21:55.022 --> 21:57.607
Hey, chill out, huh?

21:58.150 --> 21:59.693
Hey, just hear me out.

21:59.776 --> 22:01.862
I was gonna turn myself in.

22:01.945 --> 22:03.864
I'm not trying to pull anything here.

22:04.364 --> 22:06.533
Hey, you know me, right?

22:06.616 --> 22:08.660
You've seen my letters back at my place.

22:08.744 --> 22:11.038
Do you think I'm here
to negotiate with you, motherfucker?

22:11.121 --> 22:12.581
Hey, hey, calm down, kid.

22:12.664 --> 22:15.917
I'm gonna turn myself in, okay?
Along with all the evidence.

22:16.001 --> 22:21.173
It's just, I haven't done enough to this
imbecile chairman to be done with him yet.

22:21.256 --> 22:24.384
It would be…
be a real win-win for us both,

22:24.468 --> 22:27.971
if the chairman lived and you got
a big promotion. What do you say?

22:32.017 --> 22:33.727
-You…
-That was the last blank.

22:33.810 --> 22:35.687
So keep on running your mouth.

22:36.813 --> 22:38.398
You uptight bastard.

22:39.232 --> 22:40.275
Tell me, sir.

22:41.401 --> 22:42.611
You ever shot a person?

22:47.074 --> 22:49.451
You don't believe I can?

22:52.079 --> 22:53.246
Hey, just a minute.

22:54.373 --> 22:55.832
Wait a minute. Wait a minute.

22:56.583 --> 22:58.251
You…

22:59.086 --> 23:00.962
Gap-su's kid? Huh?

23:01.630 --> 23:03.048
Hey, Jang Nan-gam!

23:06.218 --> 23:09.096
Hey! Look how much you've grown.

23:09.179 --> 23:11.848
Feels like yesterday
you were in those poopy diapers.

23:12.974 --> 23:14.309
How's your mother doing?

23:24.653 --> 23:25.529
Hello?

23:27.030 --> 23:29.741
I… told you not to call me at home.

23:30.492 --> 23:32.119
Did you see Nan-gam today?

23:33.787 --> 23:35.163
Aah!

23:35.747 --> 23:36.957
Have you eaten?

23:37.040 --> 23:38.667
Hey, little man!

23:39.292 --> 23:41.253
God!

23:41.336 --> 23:43.839
Little Nan-gam is a detective now.

23:46.842 --> 23:49.886
Yikes!So much goddamn fun, huh?

23:53.306 --> 23:54.808
Aah! What?

23:56.435 --> 23:59.855
You wanna get your revenge
for what I did to your pa?

24:03.066 --> 24:04.234
Come on, do it.

24:12.159 --> 24:13.535
Do it, buddy, come on.

24:15.954 --> 24:16.955
What?

24:17.998 --> 24:19.416
You can't, huh?

24:20.000 --> 24:22.252
-Are you scared?
-Where is he? Where is he?

24:25.547 --> 24:26.756
And now?

24:29.634 --> 24:33.430
That fucking bastard, damn it.
Hey, hey, sir, calm down. Take it easy.

24:33.513 --> 24:35.056
Get down. Get down!

24:35.140 --> 24:38.226
911! Call 911 now! Shit.

24:38.310 --> 24:40.812
Hurry! He's dying.

24:46.651 --> 24:48.778
You're a rascal, bud.

24:53.700 --> 24:57.412
So, he was stabbed,
like this, in the carotid artery.

24:57.496 --> 24:59.289
Yes, go on.

25:00.165 --> 25:02.125
-Hello, sir.
-Hey.

25:02.626 --> 25:06.379
Ah, jeez. It would've been perfect
if Chairman Hyeong had just survived.

25:08.882 --> 25:11.718
Well, you should've given me a heads-up.

25:12.344 --> 25:14.429
Sorry. It's just that we were in a hurry.

25:15.514 --> 25:16.932
-Detective Jang.
-Yeah.

25:17.724 --> 25:18.600
Listen.

25:19.184 --> 25:22.812
Song Chon was the target
of the entire investigation, right?

25:23.855 --> 25:25.357
-Right.
-Mm.

25:25.941 --> 25:29.027
So let's not do an investigation
on Chairman Hyeong, then.

25:29.110 --> 25:31.696
Let's not stir up
any extra trouble here, okay?

25:31.780 --> 25:33.281
-Like his personal life.
-Ah, of course.

25:33.365 --> 25:35.367
-I understand what you mean.
-Yeah?

25:36.660 --> 25:41.039
Also, there will be a lot of
media focus on you and this case.

25:42.082 --> 25:45.585
A detective catches the guy who attacked
his father and left him brain-dead.

25:45.669 --> 25:47.170
That's nice. Huh?

25:47.254 --> 25:50.465
You know, people eat up
that kind of story. A real tear-jerker.

25:52.259 --> 25:55.345
You'll be swamped with interviews,
so you can take it easy for a while.

25:56.304 --> 25:58.223
And when you're on TV, well,

25:58.765 --> 26:02.394
just try to look sorry for not being
able to save Chairman Hyeong's life.

26:02.477 --> 26:04.354
-Like you… blame yourself.
-Okay. Yep.

26:04.896 --> 26:05.981
-Got it?
-Yes, sir.

26:06.064 --> 26:07.232
Okay.

26:08.066 --> 26:09.609
-Okay. See you.
-Good night, sir.

26:10.235 --> 26:11.444
Oh, and another thing.

26:12.529 --> 26:15.574
I heard that your father's
in Gwangjin Hospital.

26:16.783 --> 26:18.243
That's correct.

26:21.788 --> 26:25.375
I asked them to go ahead
and transfer him to the police hospital.

26:26.668 --> 26:28.086
A token of my gratitude.

27:14.257 --> 27:16.259
GWANGCHEON SERVICE AREA

27:28.688 --> 27:30.148
You know, my parents,

27:31.232 --> 27:32.984
they died when I was really young.

27:54.923 --> 27:56.925
A robber broke into our house.

27:57.509 --> 28:00.470
Did you hear his voice?
Or anything like that?

28:02.305 --> 28:04.015
I couldn't even get my revenge.

28:06.142 --> 28:07.852
I didn't know who the culprit was…

28:10.855 --> 28:12.941
and no one even tried to find them.

28:15.276 --> 28:16.403
That's when I realized.

28:19.864 --> 28:22.575
You need power to carry out justice.

28:35.630 --> 28:36.631
Oh.

28:40.260 --> 28:41.511
But I was weak.

28:49.519 --> 28:52.439
So I decided to borrow power.

29:19.841 --> 29:20.842
Hey.

29:22.135 --> 29:23.553
Can you guys, um,

29:24.679 --> 29:26.181
loosen these a little bit?

29:26.973 --> 29:27.932
The cuffs.

29:28.558 --> 29:31.728
He cuffed me way too tight.
It's so hard to breathe.

29:32.353 --> 29:35.899
Ugh. Can't you keep
your mouth shut for two seconds? Shit.

29:35.982 --> 29:36.900
Hey.

29:37.400 --> 29:40.862
You wanna have your culprit die
before your eyes? Huh?

29:40.945 --> 29:44.115
Quiet, asshole. Don't try that on us.

29:44.199 --> 29:46.409
Oh, so you boys think I'm lying?

29:46.910 --> 29:49.412
How are you gonna deal
with the aftermath, huh?

29:49.496 --> 29:53.708
Look. Look! Take a look at my hands.

29:54.375 --> 29:56.002
-Ah, God.
-I've got diabetes.

29:56.085 --> 29:58.838
And anemia.

29:58.922 --> 30:00.840
-Hey. Just loosen it up a bit.
-I--

30:00.924 --> 30:03.593
-Just a little. Not all the way.
-Oh, man.

30:03.676 --> 30:06.221
-Okay.
-Cut it out. Stop moving.

30:06.304 --> 30:07.305
Here.

30:11.267 --> 30:12.519
Oh!

30:14.771 --> 30:15.772
Hey, grab him!

30:22.695 --> 30:23.988
I'm gonna kill you!

30:24.572 --> 30:25.573
You bastard!

30:26.950 --> 30:27.867
Hey!

30:44.050 --> 30:45.260
Die, asshole!

32:07.133 --> 32:09.093
-Hello, sir.
-Oh, hello.

32:09.177 --> 32:10.261
Thank you for coming.

32:11.137 --> 32:12.972
Why don't you go and have some food?

32:17.185 --> 32:18.686
Hey. You're here.

32:19.646 --> 32:21.814
-I haven't eaten yet. No time.
-Hello, sir.

32:22.315 --> 32:25.693
There are way too many eyes on me.
The public eye can be scary.

32:26.778 --> 32:30.490
People always draw their own conclusions,
based on how they look at things.

32:32.200 --> 32:34.327
-Go ahead, take a seat.
-Yes, sir.

32:34.994 --> 32:36.037
Hey, take this.

32:36.120 --> 32:38.873
-Sir.
-Go get a new one. That one hurts. Jeez.

32:40.917 --> 32:42.293
So, what are you thinking?

32:43.086 --> 32:47.507
Uh, we'll put an APB out
and do everything we can to catch them.

32:48.716 --> 32:50.677
I heard there were accomplices as well.

32:50.760 --> 32:53.221
The thing is,
there aren't any direct connections,

32:53.304 --> 32:55.264
so we have to continue our search.

32:55.348 --> 32:57.100
So, make something up if you must.

32:57.183 --> 32:59.185
You have to get them now.

32:59.268 --> 33:02.313
You know our citizens expect
law enforcement to act quickly.

33:03.106 --> 33:05.650
You can't let a criminal
get away on your watch.

33:05.733 --> 33:08.695
The case will get out of control
if they're not apprehended.

33:08.778 --> 33:10.655
Yes, you're right, sir.

33:11.406 --> 33:14.075
Hey, I told you
not to bring eel, asshole.

33:14.158 --> 33:15.702
Try not to worry about it, sir.

33:15.785 --> 33:18.121
I'll wrap up this case
as fast as possible.

33:28.214 --> 33:30.425
I heard you two were very close.

33:32.385 --> 33:34.262
It won't amount to much, but…

33:39.350 --> 33:41.310
…were transported
to the hospital.

33:42.020 --> 33:44.647
The bus driver and passengers
only suffered minor injuries…

33:44.731 --> 33:46.065
-Hyung.
-Hmm?

33:46.149 --> 33:47.817
The police officers and passengers…

33:47.900 --> 33:50.987
How'd you get the money
for the car and all that?

33:51.070 --> 33:51.988
…critical condition.

33:52.071 --> 33:53.823
I thought you spent all your money.

33:53.906 --> 33:54.949
…not yet been identified.

33:55.033 --> 33:57.618
Mm, I sold everything. My figurines.

33:57.702 --> 33:59.078
…most likely the case…

33:59.162 --> 34:00.747
-Yeah.
-Some breaking news.

34:00.830 --> 34:04.292
The serial killer Song Chon,
who was arrested late last night,

34:04.375 --> 34:07.670
murdered two officers while being
transported to the police station

34:07.754 --> 34:08.921
and has escaped.

34:09.464 --> 34:12.717
In order to prevent further crimes,
authorities sent out an alert.

34:12.800 --> 34:15.928
They are sending military units as well,
to inspect the surrounding area.

34:16.012 --> 34:18.056
-It's okay.
-Also to run several checkpoints.

34:18.139 --> 34:22.477
-We just have to get to a secure place.
-They stated he may not have acted alone.

34:22.560 --> 34:24.353
He had accomplices helping him.

34:24.979 --> 34:27.315
The authorities have
two individuals suspected

34:27.398 --> 34:29.734
to have met Song Chon to plan the murder

34:29.817 --> 34:32.153
and are now focusing
on their relationship.

34:34.113 --> 34:35.239
Oppa.

34:35.323 --> 34:36.741
Oppa!

34:39.994 --> 34:40.995
What?

34:44.457 --> 34:47.668
The pepper isn't too spicy,
but the soup came out really good.

34:47.752 --> 34:48.753
Give it a try.

34:49.629 --> 34:51.047
Eat up, honey.

34:53.091 --> 34:56.177
Honey, you're not gonna eat?

34:58.721 --> 34:59.847
You should eat first.

35:03.392 --> 35:06.270
These two men,
whose whereabouts are currently unknown,

35:06.354 --> 35:08.815
are respectively in their 20s and 30s,

35:08.898 --> 35:11.984
and they're both speculated
to have conspired with Song Chon.

35:23.037 --> 35:25.206
-Are you okay?
-Son of a bitch! Shit! Shit!

35:25.289 --> 35:27.250
I'm such a fuckin' idiot.

35:32.046 --> 35:34.090
No, you're not an idiot.

35:35.633 --> 35:37.635
But that's the reality. 'Cause I'm…

35:39.011 --> 35:41.973
I can't do anything
on my own, Roh Bin.

35:47.728 --> 35:50.064
I have a new plan, all right?

35:51.899 --> 35:54.569
L… let's go to a warm country.

35:56.404 --> 35:57.613
Warm country?

35:59.574 --> 36:00.449
How, though?

36:00.533 --> 36:02.034
We'll sneak onto a boat.

36:03.035 --> 36:04.036
We'll hide.

36:58.216 --> 36:59.383
It's all so boring.

36:59.467 --> 37:01.344
DENTAL HEALTH, ONE OF THE FIVE BLESSINGS,

37:01.427 --> 37:03.638
HAS ALWAYS BEEN
THE INDICATOR OF YOUR BODY HEALTH

37:03.721 --> 37:05.556
WORLD DENTIST

37:09.435 --> 37:10.770
-Kid.
-Hmm?

37:11.395 --> 37:13.773
You can't just keep on
coming here, you know?

37:14.273 --> 37:16.025
We don't have anywhere else to go.

37:16.525 --> 37:18.486
Still, you can't keep this up. Come on.

37:18.569 --> 37:20.488
I already paid my debt
last time with the--

37:20.571 --> 37:22.531
Insurance fraud, draft evasion…

37:22.615 --> 37:25.117
-And that rich family's son with--
-Yeah, yeah. Okay.

37:25.201 --> 37:28.704
I understand what you're saying, okay?
But you can't keep coming here.

37:29.747 --> 37:33.042
So tell me,
are you gonna settle down, finally?

37:33.542 --> 37:37.338
Well, if you didn't want this to happen,
you should've led a cleaner life.

37:37.421 --> 37:41.884
Or you should've updated and managed
your server with all your ledgers.

37:42.385 --> 37:43.386
You didn't, though.

37:45.221 --> 37:48.057
Yo, so according to the stowaways
that arrived last week…

37:48.140 --> 37:49.183
Mm-hmm?

37:49.267 --> 37:53.062
…the Taean route is completely
shut down because of the crackdowns.

37:53.145 --> 37:55.856
Yeah, that's because
Taean requires a transfer.

37:55.940 --> 37:57.233
-Mm.
-So…

37:58.484 --> 38:01.028
Taking a straight route is best.

38:01.112 --> 38:05.074
You know? So we're going here directly
with the speedboat, with no transfer.

38:05.157 --> 38:06.867
-Mm.
-So we should be okay.

38:07.368 --> 38:10.913
Okay. So, simply put,

38:10.997 --> 38:13.833
back then, we had to travel
all the way here and then transfer,

38:13.916 --> 38:15.501
so it was complicated.

38:16.419 --> 38:20.047
But now, you can go on a speedboat
directly from here.

38:20.131 --> 38:21.841
Huh? Much simpler.

38:23.426 --> 38:25.303
How much will it cost us?

38:25.386 --> 38:28.431
-Well, the price is great.
-He's using a speedboat now.

38:28.514 --> 38:31.392
So you just need
to give him some hazard pay.

38:32.560 --> 38:35.646
Uh… do you have slower boats?

38:36.272 --> 38:37.440
-Slower?
-Yeah.

38:39.567 --> 38:41.652
If you try to do that,

38:42.570 --> 38:44.613
you have to transfer,
so that means two boats.

38:44.697 --> 38:46.657
It'll cost twice as much in the end.

38:47.283 --> 38:49.243
-It's a lot more costly.
-Hmm.

38:51.537 --> 38:52.538
What do you think?

38:54.081 --> 38:54.957
Huh.

39:03.924 --> 39:04.759
Hello?

39:05.259 --> 39:06.927
Is this Mr. Jang Nan-gam?

39:07.470 --> 39:10.931
This is Gwangjin Hospital.
You're Mr. Jang Gap-su's guardian, right?

39:11.015 --> 39:11.932
Yes.

39:12.016 --> 39:14.393
Your mother isn't
answering the phone right now.

39:15.102 --> 39:17.271
I'm calling you
in regards to your decision.

39:18.105 --> 39:19.148
On the DNR?

39:19.732 --> 39:23.152
It looks like you and your mother are
the only family members we have on file.

39:23.235 --> 39:24.737
Is that correct?

39:24.820 --> 39:26.405
Yes. What's going on?

39:27.239 --> 39:30.576
So, you and your mother have both signed
the necessary paperwork.

39:30.659 --> 39:34.497
-We'll process your request and then--
-Excuse me, ma'am. Uh, hold on.

39:34.580 --> 39:35.498
Yes?

39:37.375 --> 39:39.126
My mother signed the paperwork too?

39:39.210 --> 39:41.879
Yes, Miss Shin Jeong-hui signed it.

39:41.962 --> 39:45.383
If you've changed your mind,
we have to perform intubation right now.

39:46.592 --> 39:48.928
You have to make the decision
immediately, sir.

39:49.887 --> 39:52.473
Do you want to continue the treatment,
or should we stop?

39:53.557 --> 39:54.892
Um…

39:56.185 --> 39:58.312
Or do you need some time to think it over?

40:00.272 --> 40:01.565
Hmm…

40:04.944 --> 40:05.861
Hello?

40:07.029 --> 40:07.905
Sir?

40:13.953 --> 40:15.830
Hmm…

40:24.088 --> 40:25.089
Just do it.

40:25.589 --> 40:27.508
Sorry? Do you want us to treat him?

40:28.384 --> 40:29.802
Yes, that's correct.

40:30.970 --> 40:33.472
Okay, I'll let the doctors know,
and we'll proceed.

41:42.041 --> 41:44.126
We just got a signal
on Song Chon's burner phone.

41:44.210 --> 41:46.295
We're tracking his location now.

41:46.378 --> 41:49.131
9561, 9651.

41:49.215 --> 41:50.466
Pull over to the side.

42:01.143 --> 42:04.688
God. What's this about?
Did I do something wrong?

42:04.772 --> 42:06.482
We need to check your vehicle.

42:07.149 --> 42:11.529
-I'm here to deliver materials to a shop.
-Hey, I found something here.

42:11.612 --> 42:13.531
-Really? What is it?
-Huh?

42:14.865 --> 42:15.908
Is this not it?

42:16.408 --> 42:18.202
That's the one. It's on, right?

42:36.053 --> 42:37.137
Come again.

42:58.450 --> 43:01.579
WORLD DENTIST

43:02.413 --> 43:03.247
Hello?

43:03.998 --> 43:04.999
Hey, Bin.

43:07.585 --> 43:08.544
It's me.

43:09.128 --> 43:10.170
Where ya headed?

43:12.464 --> 43:14.258
You know, uh…

43:14.758 --> 43:17.386
…we're all wanted by the cops now, right?

43:17.469 --> 43:19.096
And you're my accomplices.

43:19.179 --> 43:21.599
Shouldn't we have a meeting
or something like that?

43:22.558 --> 43:26.061
Do you really think
that I won't know where you're going?

43:27.396 --> 43:29.106
Come to the factory in Osan.

43:29.857 --> 43:31.191
You know where it is.

43:32.526 --> 43:36.822
Oh, I have that book too.
The one that you took.

43:43.162 --> 43:44.204
Who was that?

43:45.956 --> 43:47.625
Uh… it was nothing.

43:52.171 --> 43:54.506
We can't
go on the highway with this car.

43:55.007 --> 43:56.634
The cops will find us instantly.

43:56.717 --> 43:58.552
Shit.

43:59.345 --> 44:00.512
EUNSUNG CHICKEN

44:00.596 --> 44:03.724
A van for the industrial complex
will come in 30 minutes.

44:04.433 --> 44:06.769
You take that
and get off at the destination.

44:07.269 --> 44:10.064
It… it'll be a ten-minute walk
to Boryeong Port.

44:11.440 --> 44:14.526
If anyone asks why you're there,
though they probably won't,

44:14.610 --> 44:17.488
you can just tell them
you're there to unload shipments.

44:20.824 --> 44:22.993
What about you? You're not gonna go?

44:25.412 --> 44:28.999
It's… Look, we shouldn't go together.
Too much of a risk.

44:30.751 --> 44:33.921
I'll take buses and go
on a little detour first. Don't worry.

44:36.298 --> 44:38.634
I'm gonna go and check out the bus routes.

44:53.315 --> 44:55.150
LOCATION TRACKER

45:04.284 --> 45:05.244
BORYEONG, ME

45:10.290 --> 45:11.500
ADD CONTACT
LEE TANG

45:11.583 --> 45:12.668
CONNECTED TO LEE TANG

45:12.751 --> 45:13.627
TANG

45:22.386 --> 45:23.220
2:00 a.m.

45:23.971 --> 45:27.391
That's our goal, to arrive safely
at our destination by then.

45:28.851 --> 45:29.935
Just focus on that.

45:34.314 --> 45:37.067
-So is there somewhere--
-I guess not.

45:37.151 --> 45:39.361
-I'm not sure--
-Yeah. What is it? One of those--

45:40.195 --> 45:42.781
-Yeah--
-I'll figure it out. Thanks.

46:26.658 --> 46:27.826
-Here.
-Thanks.

46:28.660 --> 46:30.996
Wait. One sec.
There should be another one?

46:31.079 --> 46:34.875
We still have a lot of time left.
We'll get going later, when it gets dark.

46:34.958 --> 46:36.668
-You should head in.
-We need another one.

46:41.924 --> 46:43.342
ZHANG YU ZHI

47:07.616 --> 47:08.492
What the…

47:12.037 --> 47:14.248
What the hell? Why won't it work?

47:14.832 --> 47:16.750
Why won't it open?

47:26.426 --> 47:27.302
Hello.

47:30.764 --> 47:35.811
Uh, I think I know
where Song Chon is hiding.

47:36.562 --> 47:37.437
So I came here.

47:47.239 --> 47:49.366
Why'd you go to Gajok Construction?

47:50.033 --> 47:52.077
And don't try to bullshit me, either.

47:53.537 --> 47:56.290
Just so…
so I could try and catch Song Chon.

48:01.003 --> 48:02.671
Who are you to try and catch him?

48:04.131 --> 48:05.007
Hmm?

48:06.174 --> 48:08.218
Song Chon, Lee Tang.

48:09.678 --> 48:12.180
You used those assholes
just to murder all those people.

48:12.264 --> 48:13.473
What's wrong with you?

48:15.517 --> 48:18.520
Do you know how many people died
because of your fucked-up ideals?

48:20.898 --> 48:23.650
So I guess you have
a clean conscience, then?

48:24.902 --> 48:25.986
What'd you say?

48:26.737 --> 48:29.865
I heard that you let
Chairman Hyeong get killed too.

48:31.992 --> 48:33.452
Wow. So it must be true.

48:34.536 --> 48:37.456
Also, I didn't hack the system
to learn that.

48:38.790 --> 48:41.919
One of the bodyguards,
he put it up online, anonymously.

49:00.270 --> 49:02.397
You can't be in here. No, don't…

49:26.213 --> 49:27.255
Oh…

49:35.472 --> 49:36.932
Jeong-seon, is that you?

50:12.759 --> 50:15.637
What the hell do you want from me anyway?

50:16.888 --> 50:19.725
Song Chon.
I just wanna help you catch him, okay?

50:21.101 --> 50:23.103
I know him better than anyone else.

50:27.190 --> 50:29.026
